note TEST ONLY link-time replacement for chan/dma.om; never a production fallback.
note Real anonymous mapnew/mapget/mapset/mapdrop remain active. No device fd is opened or used.
note Reject tuple/order mismatches so replay cannot silently bless a missing lifecycle call.
global mmduout ulong 1
global drmaps ulong 1
global drunmaps ulong 1
global drdrops ulong 1
global drlive ulong 1
global drmrc long 1
global drurc long 1
global drdrc long 1
global drusize ulong 1
fn mmdmaop op ulong fd int h long iova ulong size ulong to long
ret drdma op fd h iova size
end
fn mmdrop h long to long
ret drdrop h
end
